        "activities": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Bugun nimani o'rganamiz?\n\nKafe yoki do'konda kerak bo'ladigan ovqat va ichimlik so'zlarini o'rganamiz va ularni gapda ishlatamiz: stolda nima **bor**ligini aytish va biror narsani **muloyim so'rash** (*I would like ...*)." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 3,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## So'z boyligi\n\n| Inglizcha | O'zbekcha |\n| --- | --- |\n| bread | non |\n| rice | guruch / palov guruchi |\n| apple | olma |\n| egg | tuxum |\n| water | suv |\n| tea | choy |\n| coffee | qahva |\n| juice | sharbat |\n\n**Muloqot namunasi:** *I would like a coffee, please.* (Menga bir qahva bering.) Muloyim so'rash uchun **I would like ...** (qisqasi *I'd like ...*)." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXAMPLE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "- There is **an apple** on the table.\n- There are **two eggs** in the box.\n- I would like **a tea**, please.\n- Would you like **some water**?\n- We have **bread** and **rice** at home." }
          },
          {
            "type": "MINI_QUESTION",
